s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:07.150Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"b2a2e4e2-df23-4faa-ad41-5c4013f8e1d7","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"b2a2e4e2-df23-4faa-ad41-5c4013f8e1d7","session_id":"288c7339-c215-431a-8d72-9d21662548e9","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"21dc1424-c602-430c-810c-b5cd8cd52749","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"129a4b77-b7c6-45cd-92c8-0a5008e613ab","thread":"21dc1424-c602-430c-810c-b5cd8cd52749","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-129a4b77-b7c6-45cd-92c8-0a5008e613ab"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-sm9hstqn/state/worktrees/b2a2e4e2-df23-4faa-ad41-5c4013f8e1d7","base_commit":"72e1efcbbe96c6ac04325992ead65500739044c6","card_snapshot_id":"b490e0ff-50c9-4dd9-98ba-acb3e30dd165","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:08.352Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"b2a2e4e2-df23-4faa-ad41-5c4013f8e1d7","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-sm9hstqn/repo","cat-file","-t","b3c80cf179577a3bc4d869b09b1a0847383114e3"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-sm9hstqn/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:08.358Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"b2a2e4e2-df23-4faa-ad41-5c4013f8e1d7","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-sm9hstqn/repo","cat-file","-t","b3c80cf179577a3bc4d869b09b1a0847383114e3"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-sm9hstqn/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:08.358Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"b2a2e4e2-df23-4faa-ad41-5c4013f8e1d7","type":